{"subject":"math3","year":2009,"count":23,"origin":"source","generator":"tools/work/build_analysis_from_blocks.py（source_blocks 原文照录，零编造）","analysis":[{"id":"math3-2009-1","num":1,"desc":"函数的间断点","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2009数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（C）","【解析】$f(x)=\\dfrac{x-x^{3}}{\\sin\\pi x}$","则当 $x$ 取任何整数时，$f(x)$ 均无意义. 故 $f(x)$ 的间断点有无穷多个，但可去间断点为","极限存在的点，故应是 $x-x^{3}=0$ 的解. $x_{1}=0$，$x_{2}=1,x_{3}=-1$，","$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{x-x^{3}}{\\sin\\pi x}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{1-3x^{2}}{\\pi\\cos\\pi x}=\\dfrac{1}{\\pi}$；","$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to1}\\dfrac{x-x^{3}}{\\sin\\pi x}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to1}\\dfrac{1-3x^{2}}{\\pi\\cos\\pi x}=\\dfrac{2}{\\pi}$；$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to-1}\\dfrac{x-x^{3}}{\\sin\\pi x}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to-1}\\dfrac{1-3x^{2}}{\\pi\\cos\\pi x}=\\dfrac{2}{\\pi}$.","故可去间断点为 3 个，即 $x_{1}=0$，$x_{2}=1,x_{3}=-1$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2009-2","num":2,"desc":"等价无穷小","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2009数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（A）","【解析】$\\sin ax=ax-\\dfrac{1}{6}(ax)^{3}+o\\left(x^{3}\\right)$，$\\ln(1-bx)\\sim-bx$,所以 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{x-\\sin ax}{x^{2}\\ln(1-bx)}=$","$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{x-ax+\\dfrac{1}{6}(ax)^{3}+o\\left(x^{3}\\right)}{x^{2}(-bx)}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{x-ax+\\dfrac{1}{6}(ax)^{3}+o\\left(x^{3}\\right)}{-bx^{3}}=1,a=1,\\dfrac{a^{3}}{-6}=b$，可以解得","$a=1,b=-\\dfrac{1}{6}$. 所以选（A）"]}]},{"id":"math3-2009-3","num":3,"desc":"变限积分","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2009数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（A）","【解析】原问题可转化为求","$f(x)=\\displaystyle\\int_{1}^{x}\\dfrac{\\sin t}{t}dt-\\ln x=\\int_{1}^{x}\\dfrac{\\sin t}{t}dt-\\int_{1}^{x}\\dfrac{1}{t}dt=\\int_{1}^{x}\\dfrac{\\sin t-1}{t}dt=\\int_{x}^{1}\\dfrac{1-\\sin t}{t}dt>0$ 成立时 $x$ 的取值范围，由 $\\dfrac{1-\\sin t}{t}>0,t\\in(0,1)$ 时，知当 $x\\in(0,1)$ 时，$f(x)>0$，故应选（A）"]}]},{"id":"math3-2009-4","num":4,"desc":"变限积分的性质","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2009数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（D）","【解析】$F(x)=\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{x}f(t)dt$，$F(x_{0})$ 表示 $y=f(x)$ 与 $x$ 轴、$y$ 轴及 $x=x_{0}$ 所围成的图形的代数面积。由 $f(x)$ 的图形可知，$x\\in(-1,0)$ 时，$f(x)>0$ 且为常数,应有 $F(x)$ 单调递增且为直线函数. $x\\in(0,1)$ 时, $f(x)<0,F(x)\\leqslant0$,且单调递减. $x\\in(1,2)$ 时, $f(x)>0,F(x)$ 单调递增. $x\\in(2,3)$ 时, $f(x)=0,F(x)$ 为常函数. 正确选项为（D）"]}]},{"id":"math3-2009-5","num":5,"desc":"分块矩阵","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2009数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（B）","【解析】由于分块矩阵 $\\begin{pmatrix}\\boldsymbol{O}&\\boldsymbol{A}\\\\\\boldsymbol{B}&\\boldsymbol{O}\\end{pmatrix}$ 的行列式$\\left|\\begin{matrix}\\boldsymbol{O}&\\boldsymbol{A}\\\\\\boldsymbol{B}&\\boldsymbol{O}\\end{matrix}\\right|=(-1)^{2\\times2}\\left|\\boldsymbol{A}\\right|\\left|\\boldsymbol{B}\\right|=2\\times3=6$，即分块矩阵可逆，根据公式 $\\boldsymbol{C}^{*}=\\left|\\boldsymbol{C}\\right|\\boldsymbol{C}^{-1}$ 可得$\\begin{pmatrix}\\boldsymbol{O}&\\boldsymbol{A}\\\\\\boldsymbol{B}&\\boldsymbol{O}\\end{pmatrix}^{*}=\\left|\\begin{matrix}\\boldsymbol{O}&\\boldsymbol{A}\\\\\\boldsymbol{B}&\\boldsymbol{O}\\end{matrix}\\right|\\begin{pmatrix}\\boldsymbol{O}&\\boldsymbol{A}\\\\\\boldsymbol{B}&\\boldsymbol{O}\\end{pmatrix}^{-1}$","$=6\\begin{pmatrix}\\boldsymbol{O}&\\boldsymbol{B}^{-1}\\\\\\boldsymbol{A}^{-1}&\\boldsymbol{O}\\end{pmatrix}=6\\begin{pmatrix}\\boldsymbol{O}&\\dfrac{1}{|\\boldsymbol{B}|}\\boldsymbol{B}^{*}\\\\[2mm]\\dfrac{1}{|\\boldsymbol{A}|}\\boldsymbol{A}^{*}&\\boldsymbol{O}\\end{pmatrix}=6\\begin{pmatrix}\\boldsymbol{O}&\\dfrac{1}{3}\\boldsymbol{B}^{*}\\\\[2mm]\\dfrac{1}{2}\\boldsymbol{A}^{*}&\\boldsymbol{O}\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}\\boldsymbol{O}&2\\boldsymbol{B}^{*}\\\\3\\boldsymbol{A}^{*}&\\boldsymbol{O}\\end{pmatrix}$，故答案为","（B）"]}]},{"id":"math3-2009-6","num":6,"desc":"正交变换","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2009数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（A）","【解析】$\\boldsymbol{Q}=(\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1}+\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3})=(\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3})\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&0\\\\1&1&0\\\\0&0&1\\end{pmatrix}=(\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}_{3})\\boldsymbol{E}_{12}(1)$，即：","$\\boldsymbol{Q}=\\boldsymbol{P}\\boldsymbol{E}_{12}(1)$，$\\boldsymbol{Q}^{T}\\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{Q}=[\\boldsymbol{P}\\boldsymbol{E}_{12}(1)]^{T}\\boldsymbol{A}[\\boldsymbol{P}\\boldsymbol{E}_{12}(1)]=\\boldsymbol{E}_{12}^{T}(1)[\\boldsymbol{P}^{T}\\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{P}]\\boldsymbol{E}_{12}(1)$","$=\\boldsymbol{E}_{12}^{T}(1)\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&0\\\\1&1&0\\\\0&0&1\\end{pmatrix}\\boldsymbol{E}_{12}(1)=\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&0\\\\0&1&0\\\\0&0&1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&0\\\\0&1&0\\\\0&0&2\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&0\\\\0&1&0\\\\0&0&1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}2&1&0\\\\1&1&0\\\\0&0&2\\end{pmatrix}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2009-7","num":7,"desc":"互不相容事件","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2009数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（D）","【解析】因为 $A,B$ 互不相容，所以 $P(AB)=0$.","（A）$P=(\\overline{A}\\,\\overline{B})=P(\\overline{A\\cup B})=1-P(A\\cup B)$，因为 $P(A\\cup B)$ 不一定等于 1，所以（A）不正确；（B）当 $P(A),P(B)$ 不为 0 时，（B）不成立，故排除；（C）只有当 $A,B$ 互为对立事件的时候才成立，故排除；（D）$P=(\\overline{A}\\cup\\overline{B})=P(\\overline{AB})=1-P(AB)=1$，故（D）正确."]}]},{"id":"math3-2009-8","num":8,"desc":"随机变量函数的分布","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2009数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】（B）","【解析】$F_{z}(z)=P(XY\\leqslant z)=P(XY\\leqslant z|Y=0)P(Y=0)+P(XY\\leqslant z|y=1)P(Y=1)$","$=\\dfrac{1}{2}[P(XY\\leqslant z|Y=0)+P(XY\\leqslant z|Y=1)]$","$=\\dfrac{1}{2}[P(X\\cdot0\\leqslant z|Y=0)+P(XY\\leqslant z|Y=1)]$","由于 $X$，$Y$ 独立：得 $F_{z}(z)=\\dfrac{1}{2}[P(X\\cdot0\\leqslant z)+P(X\\leqslant z)]$.","（1）若 $z<0$，则 $F_{z}(z)=\\dfrac{1}{2}\\Phi(z)$. （2）若 $z\\geqslant0$，则 $F_{z}(z)=\\dfrac{1}{2}(1+\\Phi(z))$.","因此，$z=0$ 为间断点，故选（B）."]}]},{"id":"math3-2009-9","num":9,"desc":"泰勒展开求极限","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2009数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$\\dfrac{3e}{2}$.","【解析】$\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{e-e^{\\cos x}}{\\sqrt[3]{1+x^{2}}-1}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{e\\left(1-e^{\\cos x-1}\\right)}{\\sqrt[3]{1+x^{2}}-1}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{-e(\\cos x-1)}{\\dfrac{x^{2}}{3}}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0}\\dfrac{e\\cdot\\dfrac{x^{2}}{2}}{\\dfrac{x^{2}}{3}}=\\dfrac{3e}{2}$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2009-10","num":10,"desc":"偏导数","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2009数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$2\\ln2+1$.","【解析】由 $z=(x+e^{y})^{x}$，故 $z(x,0)=(x+1)^{x}$","$\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}\\Big|_{y=0}=[(x+1)^{x}]'=[e^{x\\ln(1+x)}]'=e^{x\\ln(1+x)}\\left[\\ln(1+x)+\\dfrac{x}{1+x}\\right]$","代入 $x=1$ 得，$\\dfrac{\\partial z}{\\partial x}\\Big|_{(1,0)}=e^{\\ln2}\\left(\\ln2+\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)=2\\ln2+1$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2009-11","num":11,"desc":"幂级数的收敛半径","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2009数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$\\dfrac{1}{e}$","【解析】由题意知，$a_{n}=\\dfrac{e^{n}-(-1)^{n}}{n^{2}}>0$","$\\left|\\dfrac{a_{n+1}}{a_{n}}\\right|=\\dfrac{e^{n+1}-(-1)^{n+1}}{(n+1)^{2}}\\cdot\\dfrac{n^{2}}{e^{n}-(-1)^{n}}=\\dfrac{n^{2}}{(n+1)^{2}}\\cdot\\dfrac{e^{n+1}\\left[1-\\left(-\\dfrac{1}{e}\\right)^{n+1}\\right]}{e^{n}\\left[1-\\left(-\\dfrac{1}{e}\\right)^{n+1}\\right]}\\to e\\,(n\\to\\infty)$","所以，该幂级数的收敛半径为 $\\dfrac{1}{e}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2009-12","num":12,"desc":"需求价格弹性","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2009数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】8000","【解析】由题意知 $\\varepsilon=-\\dfrac{P}{Q}\\dfrac{dQ}{dP}=0.2$，收益函数为 $R=PQ(P)$，收益微分为","$dR=PdQ+QdP=Q(1-\\varepsilon)dP$ 代入得 $dR=8000$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2009-13","num":13,"desc":"相似矩阵","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2009数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】2.","【解析】$\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}\\boldsymbol{\\beta}^{T}$ 相似于 $\\begin{pmatrix}3&0&0\\\\0&0&0\\\\0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}$，根据相似矩阵有相同的特征值，得到 $\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}\\boldsymbol{\\beta}^{T}$ 的特征值为 $3,0,0$.","而 $\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}^{T}\\boldsymbol{\\beta}$ 为矩阵 $\\boldsymbol{\\alpha}\\boldsymbol{\\beta}^{T}$ 的对角元素之和，所以 $1+k=3+0+0,\\therefore k=2$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2009-14","num":14,"desc":"样本均值与样本方差","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2009数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【答案】$np^{2}$.","【解析】由 $ET=E(\\overline{X}-S^{2})=E\\overline{X}-ES^{2}=np-np(1-p)=np^{2}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2009-15","num":15,"desc":"二元函数的极值","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2009数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】$f'_{x}(x,y)=2x(2+y^{2})=0$, $f'_{y}(x,y)=2x^{2}y+\\ln y+1=0$，驻点为","$x=0,y=\\dfrac{1}{e}$. $f''_{xx}=2(2+y^{2}),f''_{yy}=2x^{2}+\\dfrac{1}{y},f''_{xy}=4xy$,则","$f''_{xx}\\Big|_{\\left(0,\\frac{1}{e}\\right)}=2\\left(2+\\dfrac{1}{e^{2}}\\right)$, $f''_{xy}\\Big|_{\\left(0,\\frac{1}{e}\\right)}=0$, $f''_{yy}\\Big|_{\\left(0,\\frac{1}{e}\\right)}=e$ 在驻点，","$A=f''_{xx}>0,AC-B^{2}=f''_{xx}f''_{yy}-(f''_{xy})^{2}>0$，二元函数存在极小值 $f\\left(0,\\dfrac{1}{e}\\right)=-\\dfrac{1}{e}$"]}]},{"id":"math3-2009-16","num":16,"desc":"不定积分换元","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2009数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】令 $\\sqrt{\\dfrac{1+x}{x}}=t$ 得 $x=\\dfrac{1}{t^{2}-1}$，","原式 $=\\displaystyle\\int\\ln(1+t)d(\\dfrac{1}{t^{2}-1})=\\dfrac{\\ln(1+t)}{t^{2}-1}-\\int\\dfrac{1}{t^{2}-1}\\cdot\\dfrac{1}{t+1}dt$","$=\\dfrac{\\ln(1+t)}{t^{2}-1}-\\displaystyle\\int\\left(\\dfrac{1}{4(t-1)}+\\dfrac{-1}{4(t+1)}+\\dfrac{-1}{2(t+1)^{2}}\\right)dt=\\dfrac{\\ln(1+t)}{t^{2}-1}+\\dfrac{1}{4}\\ln\\Bigl|\\dfrac{t+1}{t-1}\\Bigr|-\\dfrac{1}{2(t+1)}+C$","$=x\\ln(1+\\sqrt{\\dfrac{1+x}{x}})+\\dfrac{1}{4}\\ln\\dfrac{\\sqrt{\\dfrac{1+x}{x}}+1}{\\sqrt{\\dfrac{1+x}{x}}-1}-\\dfrac{1}{2(\\sqrt{\\dfrac{1+x}{x}}+1)}+C$","$=x\\ln(1+\\sqrt{\\dfrac{1+x}{x}})+\\dfrac{1}{2}\\ln(\\sqrt{1+x}+\\sqrt{x})-\\dfrac{1}{2}(\\sqrt{x(x+1)}-x)+C$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2009-17","num":17,"desc":"二重积分","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2009数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】由 $(x-1)^{2}+(y-1)^{2}\\leqslant2$ 得 $r\\leqslant2(\\sin\\theta+\\cos\\theta)$，","所以 $\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{D}(x-y)dxdy=\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{3\\pi}{4}}d\\theta\\int_{0}^{2(\\sin\\theta+\\cos\\theta)}(r\\cos\\theta-r\\sin\\theta)rdr$","$=\\displaystyle\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{3\\pi}{4}}\\left[\\dfrac{1}{3}(\\cos\\theta-\\sin\\theta)r^{3}\\Big|_{0}^{2(\\sin\\theta+\\cos\\theta)}\\right]d\\theta$","$=\\displaystyle\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{3\\pi}{4}}\\dfrac{8}{3}(\\cos\\theta-\\sin\\theta).(\\sin\\theta+\\cos\\theta)^{3}d\\theta$","$=\\dfrac{8}{3}\\displaystyle\\int_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{3\\pi}{4}}(\\sin\\theta+\\cos\\theta)^{3}d(\\sin\\theta+\\cos\\theta)=\\dfrac{8}{3}\\times\\dfrac{1}{4}(\\sin\\theta+\\cos\\theta)^{4}\\Big|_{\\frac{\\pi}{4}}^{\\frac{3\\pi}{4}}=-\\dfrac{8}{3}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2009-18","num":18,"desc":"罗尔定理","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2009数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】(I) 过 $(a,f(a))$ 与 $(b,f(b))$ 的直线方程为 $f(x)=f(a)+\\dfrac{f(b)-f(a)}{b-a}(x-a)$，","取辅助函数 $F(x)=f(x)-f(a)-\\dfrac{f(b)-f(a)}{b-a}(x-a)$，则 $F(a)=F(b)$；","$F(x)$ 在 $[a,b]$ 上连续，在 $(a,b)$ 内可导，且 $F'(x)=f'(x)-\\dfrac{f(b)-f(a)}{b-a}$.","由罗尔定理，存在 $\\zeta\\in(a,b)$，使 $F'(\\zeta)=0$，即","$f'(\\zeta)-\\dfrac{f(b)-f(a)}{b-a}=0$，或 $f(b)-f(a)=f'(\\zeta)(b-a)$.","（II）任取 $x\\in(0,\\delta)$，则函数 $f(x)$ 满足：","在闭区间 $[0,x]$ 上连续，开区间 $(0,x)$ 内可导，由拉格朗日中值定理可得：","$\\exists\\eta\\in(0,x)\\subset(0,\\delta)$，使得 $f'(\\eta)=\\dfrac{f(x)-f(0)}{x-0}$，","两边取 $x\\to0^{+}$ 时的极限，注意到 $\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0^{+}}f'(x)=A$，可得","$f'_{+}(0)=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0^{+}}\\dfrac{f(x)-f(0)}{x-0}=\\lim\\limits_{x\\to0^{+}}f'(\\eta)=A$，","于是 $f'_{+}(0)$ 存在，且 $f'_{+}(0)=A$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2009-19","num":19,"desc":"旋转体体积","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2009数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】旋转体的体积为 $V=\\displaystyle\\int_{1}^{t}\\pi f(x)^{2}dx=\\pi\\int_{1}^{t}f(x)^{2}dx$，","曲边梯形的面积为：$s=\\displaystyle\\int_{1}^{t}f(x)dx$，则由题可知","$V=\\pi ts\\Rightarrow\\pi\\int_{1}^{t}f(x)^{2}dx=\\pi t\\int_{1}^{t}f(x)dx\\Rightarrow\\int_{1}^{t}f(x)^{2}dx=t\\int_{1}^{t}f(x)dx$.","两边对 $t$ 求导可得 $f(x)^{2}=\\int_{1}^{t}f(x)dx+tf(t)\\Rightarrow f(t)^{2}-tf(t)=\\int_{1}^{t}f(x)dx$","继续求导可得 $2f(t)f'(t)-f(t)-tf'(t)=f(t)$，化简可得","$(2f(t)-t)f'(t)=2f(t)$ 记 $f(t)=y$，则 $\\dfrac{dt}{dy}+\\dfrac{1}{2y}t=1$，解之得 $t=Cy^{-\\frac{1}{2}}+\\dfrac{2}{3}y$.","在（V）式中令 $t=1$，则 $f^{2}(1)-f(1)=0$,且 $f(t)>0,\\therefore f(1)=1$，代入 $t=Cy^{-\\frac{1}{2}}+\\dfrac{2}{3}y$ 得","$C=\\dfrac{1}{3}$, $\\therefore t=\\dfrac{1}{3}\\left(\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{y}}+2y\\right)$. 所以该曲线方程为：$2y+\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{y}}-3x=0$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2009-20","num":20,"desc":"非齐次线性方程组的解","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2009数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】(I) 解方程 $\\boldsymbol{A}\\boldsymbol{\\zeta}_{2}=\\boldsymbol{\\zeta}_{1}$，对增广矩阵 $\\left(\\boldsymbol{A},\\boldsymbol{\\zeta}_{1}\\right)$ 做初等行变换，","$\\left(\\boldsymbol{A},\\boldsymbol{\\zeta}_{1}\\right)\\to\\begin{pmatrix}1&-1&-1&-1\\\\-1&1&1&1\\\\0&-4&-2&-2\\end{pmatrix}\\to\\begin{pmatrix}1&-1&-1&-1\\\\0&1&\\frac{1}{2}&\\frac{1}{2}\\\\0&0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}\\to\\begin{pmatrix}1&0&-\\frac{1}{2}&-\\frac{1}{2}\\\\0&1&\\frac{1}{2}&\\frac{1}{2}\\\\0&0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}$","解得，$\\boldsymbol{\\zeta}_{2}=\\begin{pmatrix}-\\frac{1}{2}\\\\\\frac{1}{2}\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}+k_{1}\\begin{pmatrix}-\\frac{1}{2}\\\\-\\frac{1}{2}\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}$，其中 $k_{1}$ 为任意常数. 解方程 $\\boldsymbol{A}^{2}\\boldsymbol{\\zeta}_{3}=\\boldsymbol{\\zeta}_{1}$，","$\\boldsymbol{A}^{2}=\\begin{pmatrix}2&2&0\\\\-2&-2&0\\\\4&4&0\\end{pmatrix}$，对增广矩阵 $\\left(\\boldsymbol{A}^{2},\\boldsymbol{\\zeta}_{1}\\right)$ 做初等行变换，","$\\left(\\boldsymbol{A}^{2},\\boldsymbol{\\zeta}_{1}\\right)\\to\\begin{pmatrix}2&2&0&-1\\\\-2&-2&0&1\\\\4&4&0&-2\\end{pmatrix}\\to\\begin{pmatrix}1&1&0&-\\frac{1}{2}\\\\0&0&0&0\\\\0&0&0&0\\end{pmatrix}$","解得，$\\boldsymbol{\\zeta}_{3}=\\begin{pmatrix}-\\frac{1}{2}\\\\0\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}+k_{2}\\begin{pmatrix}-1\\\\1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}+k_{3}\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}$，其中 $k_{2},k_{3}$ 为任意常数.","（II）证明：由于","$\\left|\\begin{matrix}-1&-\\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{1}{2}k_{1}&-\\frac{1}{2}-k_{2}\\\\ 1&\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{1}{2}k_{1}&k_{2}\\\\ -2&k_{1}&k_{3}\\end{matrix}\\right|=\\left|\\begin{matrix}0&0&-\\frac{1}{2}\\\\ 1&\\frac{1}{2}-\\frac{1}{2}k_{1}&k_{2}\\\\ -2&k_{1}&k_{3}\\end{matrix}\\right|=-\\dfrac{1}{2}(k_{1}+1-k_{1})=-\\dfrac{1}{2}\\neq0$.","故 $\\boldsymbol{\\zeta}_{1},\\boldsymbol{\\zeta}_{2},\\boldsymbol{\\zeta}_{3}$ 线性无关."]}]},{"id":"math3-2009-21","num":21,"desc":"二次型的矩阵","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2009数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】(I) $\\boldsymbol{A}=\\begin{pmatrix}a&0&1\\\\0&a&-1\\\\1&-1&a-1\\end{pmatrix}$.","$|\\lambda\\boldsymbol{E}-\\boldsymbol{A}|=\\left|\\begin{matrix}\\lambda-a&0&-1\\\\0&\\lambda-a&1\\\\-1&1&\\lambda-a+1\\end{matrix}\\right|=\\left|\\begin{matrix}\\lambda-a&\\lambda-a&0\\\\0&\\lambda-a&1\\\\-1&1&\\lambda-a+1\\end{matrix}\\right|=\\left|\\begin{matrix}\\lambda-a&0&0\\\\0&\\lambda-a&1\\\\-1&2&\\lambda-a+1\\end{matrix}\\right|$","$=(\\lambda-a)\\left((\\lambda-a)^{2}+(\\lambda-a)-2\\right)=(\\lambda-a)(\\lambda-a-1)(\\lambda-a+2)$.","所以二次型的矩阵 $\\boldsymbol{A}$ 的特征值为 $a-2,a,a+1$.","（II）若规范形为 $y_{1}^{2}+y_{2}^{2}$，说明有两个特征值为正，一个为 0，当 $a=2$ 时，三个特征值为","$0,2,3$，得二次型的规范形为 $y_{1}^{2}+y_{2}^{2}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2009-22","num":22,"desc":"条件概率密度","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2009数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】(I) $f(x,y)=\\begin{cases}e^{-x}&0<y<x\\\\0&\\text{其他}\\end{cases}$ 得其边缘密度函数","$f_{x}(x)=\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{x}e^{-x}dy=xe^{-x}\\quad x>0$.","故 $f_{y|x}(y|x)=\\dfrac{f(x,y)}{f_{x}(x)}=\\dfrac{1}{x}\\quad 0<y<x$,","即 $f_{y|x}(y|x)=\\begin{cases}\\dfrac{1}{x}&0<y<x\\\\0&\\text{其他}\\end{cases}$.","（II）$P[X\\leqslant1,Y\\leqslant1]=\\displaystyle\\iint\\limits_{x\\leqslant1,y\\leqslant1}f(x,y)dxdy=\\int_{0}^{1}dx\\int_{0}^{x}e^{-x}dy=\\int_{0}^{1}xe^{-x}dx=1-2e^{-1}$,","$f_{Y}(y)=\\displaystyle\\int_{y}^{+\\infty}e^{-x}dx=-e^{-x}\\Big|_{y}^{+\\infty}=e^{-y},y>0$,","所以 $P[Y\\leqslant1]=\\displaystyle\\int_{0}^{1}e^{-y}dy=-e^{-y}\\Big|_{0}^{1}=-e^{-1}+1=1-e^{-1}$,","所以 $P[X\\leqslant1,Y\\leqslant1]=\\dfrac{1-2e^{-1}}{1-e^{-1}}=\\dfrac{e-2}{e-1}$."]}]},{"id":"math3-2009-23","num":23,"desc":"古典概型","origin":"source","coveredRoles":["analysis"],"source":"2009数学三真题及解析.pdf","nodes":[{"type":"text","label":"完整推导","lines":["【解析】(I) 在没有取白球的情况下取了一次红球，利用样本空间的缩减法，相当于只有 1 个红球，2 个黑球放回摸两次，其中摸一个红球的概率，所以 $P\\{X=1|Z=0\\}=$","$\\dfrac{C_{2}^{1}\\times2}{3^{2}}=\\dfrac{4}{9}$.","（II）$X$，$Y$ 取值范围为 $0,1,2$，故","$P(X=0,Y=0)=\\dfrac{C_{3}^{1}\\times C_{3}^{1}}{6^{2}}=\\dfrac{1}{4}$,$P(X=1,Y=0)=\\dfrac{C_{2}^{1}\\times C_{3}^{1}}{6^{2}}=\\dfrac{1}{6}$;","$P(X=2,Y=0)=\\dfrac{1}{6^{2}}=\\dfrac{1}{36}$,$P(X=0,Y=1)=\\dfrac{C_{2}^{1}\\times C_{2}^{1}\\times C_{3}^{1}}{6^{2}}=\\dfrac{1}{3}$;","$P(X=1,Y=1)=\\dfrac{C_{2}^{1}\\times C_{2}^{1}}{6^{2}}=\\dfrac{1}{9}$,$P(X=2,Y=1)=0$;","$P(X=0,Y=2)=\\dfrac{C_{2}^{1}\\times C_{2}^{1}}{6^{2}}=\\dfrac{1}{9}$,$P(X=1,Y=2)=0$,$P(X=2,Y=2)=0$.","（原卷为分布表，逐格照录）$X\\backslash Y$：0，1，2；$X=0$ 行：1/4，1/3，1/9；$X=1$ 行：1/6，1/9，0；$X=2$ 行：1/36，0，0."]}]}]}